text My name wasn't Katsuki Shima.
text I was just playing Katsuki Shima's role.
text His mother didn't even raise an eyebrow when she looked at me.
text To her, I hadn't been anyone in particular.
text She saw me as just another one of Katsuki Shima's friends, just like Saki-san and Yuki-san.
text Yes, that's right...
text The person most dear to me in this entire world...
text That had been the true Katsuki Shima.
text I'd been together with him for a long time.
text And in the end, he entrusted me with a single wish.
text The reason I came all the way here was to fulfill that wish.
text To grant his first love...
text To grant Misae-san... a single wish.
